{"t":"Key 3304","s":"key-3304-144ba","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Golden_Key_1d033b.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"number\">Key 3304</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Golden Key\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Golden_Key_1d033b.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also Known As</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/quest/the-outlaw-camp-quest\">Bright Sword Quest</a> Key #4</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"primarytype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Item Class</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Golden Key </p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.00 oz.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"origin\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Origin</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">A chest in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Wild%20Warrior\">Wild Warrior</a> cave in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Outlaw%20Camp\">Outlaw Camp</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"shortnotes\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Notes</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Used to open the door to the <a href=\"#/quest/the-outlaw-camp-quest\">Bright Sword Quest</a> reward room.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Loot value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>(not bought by NPCs)</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>(not sold by NPCs)</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">6.4<br/>November 2, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Keys <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-key-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Search in the Outlaw camp south-west of the village for an obscured shovel hole. You will need <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203303\">Key 3303</a> to get this key.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline